# Ep.09 — Deep Dive into Subqueries

> 📺 Watch this episode: https://youtu.be/MxmdJbzqaaY

---

## 📌 What You Will Learn

- What a subquery is and how it executes
- Subquery in WHERE — filter rows using a subquery result
- Subquery in SELECT — scalar subquery per row
- Subquery in FROM — derived tables
- Subquery in HAVING — filter groups
- IN vs NOT IN — and the NULL trap to avoid
- EXISTS vs NOT EXISTS — faster alternative
- Correlated subqueries — runs once per row
- When to use subquery vs JOIN

